flowchart TD
    Start([nodeStart])
    Code[code]
    Test[test]
    Decide[decide]
    Compress[compressHistory]
    Fix[fix]
    Finish([nodeFinish: Done!])

    Start --> Code
    Code --> Test

    Test -->|history too long = false| Decide
    Test -->|history too long = true| Compress
    Compress --> Decide

    Decide -->|problems not empty| Fix
    Fix --> Test
    Decide -->|no problems| Finish
